OL,3,GNEWSAMore schools embrace smartphone
OL,4,Afree approach
OL,5,
OL,6,FAll primary schools in a Kent town have
OL,7,Fadopted a smartphone free policy for
OL,8,Fthe new academic year.
OL,10,FThe policy means smartphones are banned
OL,11,Fon all 17 primary school sites in
OL,12,FTunbridge Wells, as well as an upcoming
OL,13,Fban for students in Year 7 and 8 from
OL,14,FSeptember 2027.
OL,16,FSmartwatches and other devices that
OL,17,Fhave internet access will also be
OL,18,Fbanned from the sites.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
