OL,3,GNEWSAMore schools embrace smartphone
OL,4,Afree approach
OL,5,
OL,6,FExemptions will apply on medical
OL,7,Fgrounds and primary school students in
OL,8,FYear 5 and 6 at some sites will be
OL,9,Fpermitted to bring in a "brick phone",
OL,10,Fif it has no internet access and is
OL,11,F"necessary" for travel.
